From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:29:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Hold a playlist's drop until its write returns

The playlist pages kept a dropped order until the playlist's read held
the same entries, and dropped it on the next read. Both apps now keep the
dropped order until the reorder returns, then draw the read, which shows
what is stored whether the write took or not.

